WEBVTT

00:00:27.796 --> 00:00:30.556
Some of our islands are coral atolls,

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.596
others are volcanic,

00:00:32.596 --> 00:00:37.716
covered with hills,
ancient forests and mangroves,

00:00:37.756 --> 00:00:42.836
all with beautiful beaches
bordering the crystal-clear sea,

00:00:42.836 --> 00:00:47.156
which is alive with incredible,
rare marine life.

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:50.556
But our home is now threatened
by climate change.

00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:53.836
The climate crisis
is causing sea levels to rise,

00:00:53.836 --> 00:00:56.596
and brings so much pollution
to our shores.

00:00:56.636 --> 00:00:59.796
Plastics drift in
from thousands of miles away,

00:00:59.836 --> 00:01:01.396
washing up on our beaches,